Cell[TextData[{
 "In the product, each lift closes on its initial state. In the twisted \
cover, the lift from vertex 1 ends at vertex 17, and the other lift returns \
from 17 to 1. Thus one base circuit exchanges the two states. ",
 ButtonBox["InfraHolonomy",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraHolonomy"], None},
  ButtonNote->"paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraHolonomy"],
 " computes this transposition."
}], "Text",
 CellDingbat->None,ExpressionUUID->"d74e20f2-c091-4ab4-beb2-1d2a56ec1402"],

Cell["\<\
This exchange prevents a continuous section over the whole base: successive \
adjacency choices force a return to the other state. The product has two \
continuous sections, one on each horizontal cycle.\
\>", "Text",
 CellDingbat->None,ExpressionUUID->"23970d53-d761-4dce-ad40-f1a93b4d1a3f"],

Cell["\<\
More generally, a covering of a connected base has a continuous section \
exactly when some state in one fiber is fixed by every closed-walk transport \
based there. A section supplies such a state because every lifted circuit \
must return to its chosen vertex. Conversely, transport a common fixed state \
to each base point along any path. Two paths give the same endpoint: \
following one and reversing the other gives a closed walk that fixes the \
starting state. For a base edge, choose the path to its second endpoint \
through its first endpoint. Its last lifted edge joins the chosen states, so \
these path-independent choices form a continuous section. Thus a nonidentity \
holonomy obstructs a section only when the holonomy permutations have no \
common fixed state.\
\>", "Text",
 CellDingbat->None,ExpressionUUID->"1a63bfe4-0320-4b61-ac46-5b48d63b986a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 ButtonBox["InfraTrivialMonodromyQ",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraTrivialMonodromyQ"], 
    None},
  ButtonNote->
   "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraTrivialMonodromyQ"],
 " tests whether every closed base walk has identity transport. Equivalently, \
each horizontal connected component contains at most one vertex above each \
base vertex. Two such vertices in one component give a lifted closed walk \
with different endpoints, and every such walk gives two such vertices."
}], "Text",
 CellDingbat->None,ExpressionUUID->"18206d1f-29dd-4b6e-bc94-e10f51179a4d"],

Cell["The same cover at coarser resolutions", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1cc70543-0cd5-4d5a-b46a-98cd260a045a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Take the double cover ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["C", "TI"], "128"], "\[Rule]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["C", "TI"], "64"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"fe93cf17-ef39-4052-8006-dca55ae40f33"],
 " and group consecutive vertices into blocks of size ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[LongEqual]", "1"}], ",", "4", ",", "16"}]}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "9d245f0b-f1fb-4681-9d0b-df4ced0f8f5f"],
 ". Apply the same blocking to the total and base cycles. Across the top row, \
the same lifted base circuit is drawn over progressively coarser bases. The \
bottom row draws each total cycle in its own layout, making the two endpoints \
of the lifted circuit visible."
}], "Text",
 CellDingbat->None,ExpressionUUID->"3f3169ba-8628-42fa-a3c3-ddb4ad9f4619"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", " ", 
    RowBox[{"total", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"CycleGraph", "[", " ", "128", " ", "]"}]}], " ", "}"}], ",", 
   "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"GraphicsGrid", "[", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Map", "[", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"block", " ", "|->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "    ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"coarseTotal", " ", "=", " ", 
              RowBox[{"InfraBaseSpace", "[", " ", 
               RowBox[{"InfraFiberedGraph", "[", " ", 
                RowBox[{"total", ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"vertex", " ", "|->", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"Ceiling", "[", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"vertex", " ", "/", " ", "block"}], " ", "]"}]}]}],
                 " ", "]"}], " ", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
             RowBox[{"baseSize", " ", "=", " ", 
              RowBox[{"64", " ", "/", " ", "block"}]}]}], " ", "}"}], ",", 
           "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"{", " ", 
            RowBox[{"fib", " ", "=", " ", 
             RowBox[{"InfraFiberedGraph", "[", " ", 
              RowBox[{"coarseTotal", ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"vertex", " ", "|->", " ", 
                RowBox[{"Mod", "[", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"vertex", ",", " ", "baseSize", ",", " ", "1"}], " ",
                  "]"}]}]}], " ", "]"}]}], " ", "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"{", " ", 
            RowBox[{"connection", " ", "=", " ", 
             RowBox[{"InfraConnection", "[", " ", 
              RowBox[{"EdgeList", "[", " ", "coarseTotal", " ", "]"}], " ", 
              "]"}]}], " ", "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"{", " ", 
            RowBox[{"lift", " ", "=", " ", 
             RowBox[{"InfraHorizontalLift", "[", " ", 
              RowBox[{
              "fib", ",", " ", "connection", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"Append", "[", " ", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"Range", "[", " ", "baseSize", " ", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                 "1"}], " ", "]"}]}], " ", "]"}]}], " ", "}"}], ",", "\n", 
           "    ", 
           RowBox[{"{", " ", 
            RowBox[{"highlights", " ", "=", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Style", "[", " ", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"InfraWalk", "[", " ", "lift", " ", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                 "StandardBlue", ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"AbsoluteThickness", "[", " ", "2.5", " ", "]"}]}], 
                " ", "]"}], ",", "\n", "        ", 
               RowBox[{"Style", "[", " ", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"InfraFiber", "[", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"fib", ",", " ", "1"}], " ", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                 "StandardOrange"}], " ", "]"}]}], " ", "}"}]}], " ", "}"}], ",",
            "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"{", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"InfraFiberedGraphHighlight", "[", " ", 
              RowBox[{"fib", ",", " ", "highlights", ",", " ", 
               
               RowBox[{"\"\<BaseGraphLayout\>\"", " ", "->", 
